<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Stride on</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/categories/stride/</link><description>Recent content in Stride on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://younsoid.github.io/categories/stride/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>패딩과 스트라이드</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/deep-learning/computer-vision/cp12/</link><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/deep-learning/computer-vision/cp12/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="패딩과-스트라이드"&gt;&#10; 패딩과 스트라이드&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ed%8c%a8%eb%94%a9%ea%b3%bc-%ec%8a%a4%ed%8a%b8%eb%9d%bc%ec%9d%b4%eb%93%9c"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-10-11&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-plain" data-lang="plain"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;입력 (5, 5, d1)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;conv2d(d2, 3, padding=&amp;#34;valid&amp;#34;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;출력 (3, 3, d2)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;5x5 입력 특성맵에서 3x3 격자는 9개를 만들수있다. 따라서 출력 특성맵은 가로세로가 2개씩 줄어들어 3x3이 된다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-plain" data-lang="plain"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;입력 (5, 5, d1)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;conv2d(d2, 3, padding=&amp;#34;same&amp;#34;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;출력 (5, 5, d2)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;입력맵과 높이, 너비가 동일한 출력맵을 얻으려면 패딩을 사용하면 된다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-plain" data-lang="plain"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;입력 (28, 28, 1)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;conv2d(d1, 3)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓ (26, 26, d1)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;max pooling(2)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;출력 (13, 13, d1)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-plain" data-lang="plain"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;입력 (28, 28, 1)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;conv2d(d1, 3, strides=2, padding=&amp;#34;same&amp;#34;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;출력 (14, 14, d1)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;특성맵을 다운샘플링할때 max pooling을 쓸수도 있지만 stride를 사용해줄수도 있다. 위처럼 경계 문제가 없는 입력맵에서는 /2로 다운샘플링된다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>